      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Hard to go past WILD BEAU (2) who was a dominant winner two on end before drawing off the track in the Palmerston Sprint, trying to lead throughout and fighting on game for third. This far easier and is the one to run down. RIVKIN (7) is coming along nicely this prep. Finished sixth when fresh from a spell two starts back at this track then improved and scored over 1200m at this track three-and-a-half weeks ago, getting home by a long neck after being in contention on the bend. Has the class to figure prominently. LIM'S BIGHORN (4) last appeared over 1200m at Caulfield Heath on June 17. Lines up today for the first time for trainer Patrick Johnston. Comes here with definite top-three claims. ARIZONA ACTIVIST (1) did a great job to score by one length over this course and distance last start in a far better run. Finds a suitable race and can continue the winning form. FLYING ANNIE (8) is a major player on best.",
